  "description": "The Chase Element frame is our second frame option and we did not cut any corners to bring you a great frame for huge value. Using innovations developed to help reduce times in road racing, Chase is excited to incorporate an Aero System Seat tube and seat post on the new Element Frame. When races are won by a fraction of a second, every bit can contribute to a win, and the aero design can help not only reduction of drag, but the new design also lightens up the overall weigh of the bike.\n\nThe 2016 Element feature 7005 T6 Alloy frame, with Butted and Hydrofromed tube, and Integrated head set, and our exclusive Aero Pivotal seat post and clamping system.\n\nThe 2016 Element frame is offered in our USA Pro Team Color Edition as well, with a polished frame and Blue graphics, to not only give you one of the best factory designed frames, but give you the factory team look as well.",
